{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 在 S09 把“想有人陪”进一步解释成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，比 Y 更替人物确定动机，少了一点心理上的含混和留白。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，X 的纵向阅读顺序、关键词加亮和感受词按音乐节点出现，让我能先抓住人物每一步在想什么，再通过具体的身体动作、声音和节奏细节感受到为什么会这样；Y 的右栏虽然方便快速浏览情绪词，但容易形成彼此并列的感受清单，与人物叙述的因果关系不够紧。尤其 X 把离开后的笃定、怀念、反复动摇、重新认识自己的需要，直到最后带着想念继续生活，串成了比较清楚的心理变化过程，而且感受细节不只是情绪标签，还有动作、触觉、呼吸和音乐形态的变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a554a7cf-fcac-42be-80f1-72e0e1daede6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T214338383277Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:44:33.834316+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "993b01f038cf3acd709325fb1ff75487739f0ee6d63d269f661cd1efe0a8713e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f9